        "text": "<b>Code Review Assistant</b>\n\nPaste a snippet and you get back structured feedback: severity ranked findings, the concrete fix for each one, test gaps and an optional rewrite.\n\n<b>How to send code</b>\nPaste it directly, or wrap it in triple backticks with a language tag for best results.\n\n<b>Flags</b> (put them before the code)\n<code>--quick</code>  top issues only\n<code>--deep</code>  adds architecture and testing analysis\n<code>--security</code>  security focused pass\n<code>--perf</code>  performance focused pass\n<code>--lang=python</code>  force a language\n\n<b>Example</b>\n<code>/review --security</code> followed by your fenced code block.",
